<title>USA: MaxServ hires advisors to evaluate offer.</title>
<headline>MaxServ hires advisors to evaluate offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>MaxServ Inc said on Friday that it hired Broadview Associates LLC as its advisors to evaluate any offer received from Sears Roebuck and Co.</p>
<p>Sears currently owns 64 percent of MaxServ's outstanding stock. On December 5, Sears expressed interest in acquiring all of MaxServ's outstanding shares of common stock.</p>
<p>MaxServ provides information services for household products, delivering diagnostic assistance and support to customers.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
